### Product Service API - Test Requests
### Replace {{baseUrl}} with your actual URL (e.g., https://localhost:7214)

@baseUrl = https://localhost:7214

### Get All Products
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Product by Code
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/F1001
Accept: application/json

###

### Create Product - Food Category
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "F1001",
  "name": "Organic Bananas",
  "category": "Food",
  "content": "Fresh organic bananas sourced from sustainable farms. Ideal for smoothies and snacking.",
  "isActive": true
}

###

### Create Product - NonFood Category
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "NF2001",
  "name": "Eco Dish Soap 500ml",
  "category": "NonFood",
  "content": "Biodegradable dish soap with natural lemon scent. Tough on grease, gentle on hands.",
  "isActive": true
}

###

### Create Product - Validation Error (Name too long)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "F1002",
  "name": "This is a very long product name that exceeds the maximum allowed length of fifty characters",
  "category": "Food",
  "content": "Test product",
  "isActive": true
}

###

### Create Product - Validation Error (Empty Name)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "F1003",
  "name": "",
  "category": "Food",
  "content": "Test product",
  "isActive": true
}

###

### Create Product - Duplicate Code (Should return 409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "F1001",
  "name": "Duplicate Product",
  "category": "Food",
  "content": "This should fail due to duplicate code",
  "isActive": true
}

###

### Update Product
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/products/F1001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Organic Bananas - Premium",
  "category": "Food",
  "content": "Premium fresh organic bananas sourced from sustainable farms.",
  "isActive": true
}

###

### Update Product - Change to Inactive
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/products/F1001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Organic Bananas",
  "category": "Food",
  "content": "Fresh organic bananas sourced from sustainable farms.",
  "isActive": false
}

###

### Update Product - Not Found (Should return 404)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/products/INVALID
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Product",
  "category": "Food",
  "content": "This should fail",
  "isActive": true
}

###

### Delete Product
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/products/F1001

###

### Delete Product - Not Found (Should return 404)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/products/INVALID

###

